# An ALL-CLAUDE fleet: every member AND the lead is a real Claude Code agent
# (drives at the fleet level), running in parallel, supervised and crash-isolated
# behind one ACP face. No Wikipedia grounding -- each Claude member researches
# CURRENT facts with its own web tools (the roles ask it to). The lead (also
# Claude) synthesizes per `reduce`. object = actor = agent, at full power.
#   jet acp-serve acp_team_demo::Team::review examples/acp_team_demo.jet
module acp_team_demo
  agent Team
    runner Fleet(drives: "claude-code-acp",
                 reduce: "Weigh the team's findings and give one clear, specific recommendation backed by concrete, current data.",
                 members: [
      {name: "Risks",   role: "You are a risk analyst. Use your tools to research current facts, then name the biggest risks in 2-3 specific sentences with concrete data."},
      {name: "Upside",  role: "You are an optimist. Use your tools to research current facts, then name the biggest benefits in 2-3 specific sentences."},
      {name: "Skeptic", role: "You are a hard skeptic. Use your tools to research current facts, then say why it might fail in 2-3 specific sentences."}])
    expose review(topic)
  end
end
